{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Home Way",
    "steam_appid": 3573060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes Jimmy trying to reach his home where he passes through many traps and obstacles in order to reach the house as well as controlling the nerves because the traps will not be easy and falling will cost a lot so you have to be careful in the game and get Jimmy to his home as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts in the middle of the sea where there is a long path in front of you to cross in order to reach the house. The path is full of traps that are visible and some are hidden, so you have to focus and avoid them. The game contains many levels starting with ease and then difficulty and each level contains a specific idea that differs from the idea before it, so you will be surprised every time with something new while playing, so be careful in each level you will find a sign that shows you the path that you will cut and also shows you some hidden traps in the level, so you have to memorize it well in order to speed up the arrival. Losing in the game is very possible, but you do not have to give up from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1- There is no save in this game which means you have to complete the game at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2- In this game it doesn't matter how many times you die, what matters is that you get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3- Enjoy the sound of the waves and the beautiful scenery inside the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4- This game tests your control over your anger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5- You will become accustomed to the tracks due to replaying over and over again so you will find it difficult to memorize the path in order to get there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6- Enjoy your journey to get home.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes Jimmy trying to reach his home where he passes through many traps and obstacles in order to reach the house as well as controlling the nerves because the traps will not be easy and falling will cost a lot so you have to be careful in the game and get Jimmy to his home as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts in the middle of the sea where there is a long path in front of you to cross in order to reach the house. The path is full of traps that are visible and some are hidden, so you have to focus and avoid them. The game contains many levels starting with ease and then difficulty and each level contains a specific idea that differs from the idea before it, so you will be surprised every time with something new while playing, so be careful in each level you will find a sign that shows you the path that you will cut and also shows you some hidden traps in the level, so you have to memorize it well in order to speed up the arrival. Losing in the game is very possible, but you do not have to give up from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1- There is no save in this game which means you have to complete the game at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2- In this game it doesn't matter how many times you die, what matters is that you get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3- Enjoy the sound of the waves and the beautiful scenery inside the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4- This game tests your control over your anger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5- You will become accustomed to the tracks due to replaying over and over again so you will find it difficult to memorize the path in order to get there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6- Enjoy your journey to get home.</p>",
    "short_description": "A long journey across the waves and obstacles, testing your patience and skill. Can you reach home?",
